          "prompt": "<p>What is the output of the code snippet? The class Test has a main method containing a try block that computes int kq = 10 / 0; and then throws a new Exception(); followed by catch blocks for ArithmeticException (prints &quot;Error1&quot;), NumberFormatException (prints &quot;Error2&quot;) and Exception (prints &quot;Error3&quot;), and a finally block that prints &quot;Finish&quot;.</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Test</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String[] args)</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n         <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">kq</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span> / <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>;\n         <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Exception</span>();\n      } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (ArithmeticException e) {\n         System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error1&quot;</span>);\n      } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (NumberFormatException e) {\n         System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error2&quot;</span>);\n      } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (Exception e) {\n         System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error3&quot;</span>);\n      } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">finally</span> {\n         System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Finish&quot;</span>);\n      }\n   }\n}</code></pre>|||<p>Kết quả (output) của đoạn mã sau là gì? Lớp Test có phương thức main chứa khối try tính int kq = 10 / 0; rồi throw new Exception(); tiếp theo là các khối catch cho ArithmeticException (in &quot;Error1&quot;), NumberFormatException (in &quot;Error2&quot;) và Exception (in &quot;Error3&quot;), cùng khối finally in &quot;Finish&quot;.</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Test</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String[] args)</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n         <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">kq</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span> / <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>;\n         <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Exception</span>();\n      } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (ArithmeticException e) {\n         System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error1&quot;</span>);\n      } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (NumberFormatException e) {\n         System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error2&quot;</span>);\n      } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (Exception e) {\n         System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error3&quot;</span>);\n      } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">finally</span> {\n         System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Finish&quot;</span>);\n      }\n   }\n}</code></pre>",
