          "prompt": "<p>What is the output of the following code snippet? Class Person declares protected String id;, a method calPerson(Person p) that sets p.id = &quot;HCM&quot;; then does System.out.print(p.id);, and a main method that does Person p = new Person(); p.id = &quot;FPT&quot;; p.calPerson(p);</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">protected</span> String id;\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">calPerson</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(Person p)</span>{\n      p.id = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HCM&quot;</span>;\n      System.out.print(p.id);\n   }\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String[] args)</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-type\">Person</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>();\n      p.id = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;FPT&quot;</span>;\n      p.calPerson(p);\n   }\n}</code></pre>|||<p>Kết quả (output) của đoạn mã sau là gì? Lớp Person khai báo protected String id;, một phương thức calPerson(Person p) gán p.id = &quot;HCM&quot;; rồi System.out.print(p.id);, và phương thức main thực hiện Person p = new Person(); p.id = &quot;FPT&quot;; p.calPerson(p);</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">protected</span> String id;\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">calPerson</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(Person p)</span>{\n      p.id = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HCM&quot;</span>;\n      System.out.print(p.id);\n   }\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String[] args)</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-type\">Person</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>();\n      p.id = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;FPT&quot;</span>;\n      p.calPerson(p);\n   }\n}</code></pre>",
